    "name": {
      "value": "Wand of Overflowing Life (5Th-Level Spell)"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "apg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This alabaster wand has a clear crystal at the tip. You cast heal at the indicated level. After you cast the spell, at the start of your next turn, excess healing magic wells up from the wand and heals you, as though you cast the 1-action version of heal on yourself at the same spell level. You gain this benefit only once, even if you cast multiple heal spells from wands of overflowing life in the same turn."
    },
